{"ID":"20251113164905-u46iyph","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251113164905-u46iyph","title":"UPL9-15——反射探针","type":"doc","updated":"20251113181052"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165501-2xkxfqu","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113165501-2xkxfqu","updated":"20251113165553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113165501-1b2f00c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165501-1b2f00c","updated":"20251113165512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前置知识："}]},{"ID":"20251113165512-r7hvvjq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165512-r7hvvjq","updated":"20251113165553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165513-wguhb8e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165513-wguhb8e","updated":"20251113165513"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165513-jr7c63s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165513-jr7c63s","updated":"20251113165522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241209025905-i5ffu4e","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S8L1——立方体纹理"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165522-0mbifb7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165522-0mbifb7","updated":"20251113165522"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165522-pdbnyf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165522-pdbnyf7","updated":"20251113165528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241217123351-2nq3plq","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S8L2——天空盒"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165529-xg1evhj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165529-xg1evhj","updated":"20251113165529"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165529-iwb2t2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165529-iwb2t2m","updated":"20251113165539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241217124926-sxok7yw","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S8L3——动态生成立方体纹理"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165540-e1vizxf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165540-e1vizxf","updated":"20251113165553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165540-evn2xgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165540-evn2xgi","updated":"20251113165553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20241219001301-uqtlfhe","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US3S8L4——反射效果"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113164905-bvnh9mq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251113164905-bvnh9mq","name":"Reflection Probe","updated":"20251113165153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射探针"}]},{"ID":"20251113164922-5g95l4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164922-5g95l4m","updated":"20251113164949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射探针（Reflection Probe）是用来捕捉某个空间内的环境反射信息的组件，Unity 通过在场景中放置一个 立方体探针（Cube Probe）\n拍摄周围环境生成一个 立方体贴图（Cubemap），运行时动态物体或表面就能从中采样反射"}]},{"ID":"20251113164922-bnfxlba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164922-bnfxlba","updated":"20251113164932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：反射探针用一张立方体贴图来模拟物体周围的反射环境，让金属、玻璃等材质看起来有倒影感"}]},{"ID":"20251113164941-6m3nw72","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113164941-6m3nw72","updated":"20251113165153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射探针（Reflection Probe）的原理"}]},{"ID":"20251113165015-89mowhf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165015-89mowhf","updated":"20251113165057"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165021-4aqazi1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-4aqazi1","updated":"20251113165057"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165021-x3ghsd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-x3ghsd2","updated":"20251113165021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251113165023-r5telfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165023-r5telfr","updated":"20251113165057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 以探针位置为中心渲染场景的 6 个方向（±X, ±Y, ±Z）生成一张 6 面的立方体贴图（Cubemap）\n这张贴图包含该点周围环境的颜色和亮度信息"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165021-xrak040","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-xrak040","updated":"20251113165021"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165021-0xvcvlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-0xvcvlc","updated":"20251113165021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运行阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251113165027-m5tlq27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165027-m5tlq27","updated":"20251113165038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于反射性材质（如金属），Shader 在像素着色时，根据该像素的法线方向\n在 Cubemap 中查找对应方向的颜色，将结果作为反射光加入最终颜色"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165021-9uq8efg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-9uq8efg","updated":"20251113165045"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165021-q4rnddt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165021-q4rnddt","updated":"20251113165021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"混合"}]},{"ID":"20251113165040-dr05ja6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165040-dr05ja6","updated":"20251113165045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若一个物体位于多个反射探针之间，Unity 会根据位置权重对反射贴图进行插值混合，保证反射在空间上连续、平滑"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165105-06zgcqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165105-06zgcqc","updated":"20251113165116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总结：反射探针就是预先烘焙好立方体贴图，当有反射效果的对象经过探针区域时，会使用该贴图进行着色，并且会帮助我们处理多探针之间的混合"}]},{"ID":"20251113165105-nsi5iig","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113165105-nsi5iig","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251113165125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113165125-yhsmrbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165125-yhsmrbi","updated":"20251113165125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：反射探针分为："}]},{"ID":"20251113165124-b63ze1r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-b63ze1r","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165124-gdyi54l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-gdyi54l","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165124-4idj358","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-4idj358","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙反射探针"}]},{"ID":"20251113165131-g00x800","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165131-g00x800","updated":"20251113165131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用于：静态场景、固定反射"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165124-styjmsy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-styjmsy","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165124-3za9jly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-3za9jly","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实时反射探针"}]},{"ID":"20251113165132-3bab855","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165132-3bab855","updated":"20251113165134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每帧渲染 6 张图，性能消耗较大，适用于：镜面、水面、动态光照变化"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165124-cf1l9f6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-cf1l9f6","updated":"20251113165124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165124-cqabaa1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165124-cqabaa1","updated":"20251113165136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义反射探针"}]},{"ID":"20251113165141-a0u123c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165141-a0u123c","updated":"20251113165141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手动指定对应的立方体贴图，适用于：特殊效果或自定义反射"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165153-q66n6m1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113165153-q66n6m1","updated":"20251113181052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反射探针（Reflection Probe）的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251113165203-fubk4jv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165203-fubk4jv","updated":"20251113181052"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165209-o03homg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-o03homg","updated":"20251113172544"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165209-i2a231d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-i2a231d","updated":"20251113165209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在场景中创建 Reflection Probe（反射探针）"}]},{"ID":"20251113172231-z4g6qhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113172231-z4g6qhp","updated":"20251113172544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Hierarchy 窗口内右键选择 Light —— Reflection Probe 即可创建"}]},{"ID":"20251113172534-zyt9kfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113172534-zyt9kfe","updated":"20251113172535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113172535-whmqqiz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165209-5xmclow","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-5xmclow","updated":"20251113165209"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165209-moupz2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-moupz2u","updated":"20251113175108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根据对象类型决定是否烘焙进反射探针的立方体贴图内"}]},{"ID":"20251113165223-aftnt4v","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113165223-aftnt4v","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251113165223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113165223-fa94axj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165223-fa94axj","updated":"20251113175131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意，如果要将物体烘焙至反射探针内，需要将静态物体勾选 Reflection Probe Static（反射探针静态对象）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113175044-5dvrjkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113175044-5dvrjkw","updated":"20251113175210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113175210-bktqcoi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113165209-yn2tekq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-yn2tekq","updated":"20251113172845"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113165209-r763abe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165209-r763abe","updated":"20251113165209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置 Reflection Probe（反射探针）相关参数"}]},{"ID":"20251113165216-rz5old5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113165216-rz5old5","updated":"20251113174232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体参数见下文："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251113172748-seha7gv","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"反射探针（Reflection Probe）的参数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nReflection P